[node name="RichTextLabel" type="RichTextLabel" parent="UI/Tutorial/MarginContainer/VBoxContainer" unique_id=1734676384]
layout_mode = 2
size_flags_vertical = 3
theme_override_font_sizes/normal_font_size = 16
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "Welcome.[br]
If you didnt know already, this game is a recreation of the factory and tower defense game [b]MINDUSTRY[/b]  by Anuke in Godot. It was made completely from scratch (except for sprites and ui icons used from Mindustry) and primarily intended as practice for creating complex combat systems like the one used in Mindustry.

This is not meant to be a direct copy of Mindustry and will not include the full content of the original game, particularly the campaign. However, content such as combat related units and blocks will be available in a sandbox style mode.

This is still currently in an early stage of development. There are many blocks or units not yet implemented.


  INTERFACE
Help - Top right (open this panel again.

Unit/Block Controller - Top left.  See current controlled block/unit's health.
Faction Switcher - Top left.  Swap current controled block/unit's faction.
Faction Control Menu - Top left.  Send attack orders to all units of the selected faction.

Block/Unit Selector - Bottom Right.  Select a block/unit to spawn. 
Faction Selector - Bottom Right.  Select a faction for the block/unit selector.

   KEYBINDS:
Ctrl + LClick = Control hovered block/unit
V                    =  De-control the currently controlled block/unit
WASD            = to move controlled unit
LClick            = Shoot with controlled block/unit
RClick            = Deselect selected block/unit or delete hovered block

MidMouse/Ctrl + RClick   = Pan camera while not controlling a unit
Scroll Wheel                    = Zoom in/out
"
fit_content = true

